 "surface_design": {
  "paraphrases": [
   "Apply each action to the state, in order. An action is applicable only if all its {pre_on} bits are set and all its {pre_off} bits are clear in the current state; an inapplicable action leaves the state unchanged. For an applicable action, apply {delete} bits first, then {add} bits.",
   "Process the actions one after another. An action may be used only when every bit of its {pre_on} mask is 1 and every bit of its {pre_off} mask is 0 in the current state; otherwise the action does nothing. When an action is used, first clear its {delete} bits, then set its {add} bits.",
   "Go through the actions in the given order. An action takes effect only if the current state has all of its {pre_on} bits on and none of its {pre_off} bits on; an action that does not take effect keeps the state the same. An action that takes effect removes its {delete} bits and then adds its {add} bits.",
   "Handle the actions in sequence. First check the preconditions: all {pre_on} bits must be set and all {pre_off} bits must be unset in the current state. If the check fails, leave the state as it is. If it passes, turn off the {delete} bits, then turn on the {add} bits.",
   "Apply the actions in order. Each action fires only when its {pre_on} bits are all present and its {pre_off} bits are all absent in the current state; an action that does not fire changes nothing. A firing action drops its {delete} bits before setting its {add} bits."
  ],
